window.products.push({"id":1175182,"name":"Sony ICF-CD815 AM/FM Stereo CD Clock Radio with Dual Alarm (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"electronics","retail price":70.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31BJAFNlFmL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Sony AM/FM Stereo CD Clock Radio From the Manufacturer A large, readable display as well as a 3.5mm jack to plug and play your digital music devices Set two separate wake up times, or use the extendable snooze to sleep up to another hour Fall asleep and wake up to your favorite music. With the ICF-CD815 multi-function clock radio, you easily choose the sounds to start and end your day. No need to worry about getting up in time with its dual alarm settings. The ICF-CD815 clock radio lets you forget about settings and focus on what's important: sleep. Connect your digital music player or insert your favorite CD and unwind before bed. Catching a few extra winks in the morning is easy with an extendable snooze button that lets you set just how long you want to put off getting up. CD-R/RW Playback with Audio Input In addition to the AM/FM tuner, the ICD-CD815 plays CD-R/RW discs burned either in a PC or a home recording deck. Create custom mixes from your existing personal music collection and always have the right music at hand. A built-in audio input with included cable allows simple plug and play integration with a digital music device via a 3.5mm jack. Highly Visible 1.4\" Green LED The display is easily viewable under a variety of lighting conditions. Whether in broad daylight or the middle of the night, the face remains easily readable. Dual Alarms with Alarm Indicators Set two separate wake-up times with individual wake-up settings and confirm that the alarm has been activated to turn on at the pre-set time. Set two separate wake-up times and wake up to a CD, the radio or a buzzer. Extendable Snooze Choose your own snooze time instead of being held captive by the short time intervals of other snooze times. Each press of the snooze button adds an additional 10 minutes to your total snooze time for up to a full hour of uninterrupted sleep. Technical Specifications Format(s) Supported: CD/CD-R/RW, MP3 Player connectivity with supplied cable Format(s) Supported: CD/CD-R/RW, MP3 Player connectivity with supplied cable Frequency Range: AM: 530-1710kHz; FM: 87.5-108MHz Frequency Range: AM: 530-1710kHz; FM: 87.5-108MHz Tuner Type: Analog Tuner Type: Analog Alarm: Dual Alarm: Dual Snooze w/Extendable Snooze: 10 Minute Intervals up to 1 Hour Snooze w/Extendable Snooze: 10 Minute Intervals up to 1 Hour Output Power: 0.7W + 0.7W (at 10% harmonic distortion) Output Power: 0.7W + 0.7W (at 10% harmonic distortion) Power Requirements: AC 120V, 60Hz Power Requirements: AC 120V, 60Hz Speaker Dimensions: 2-1/4\" (57mm) Speaker Dimensions: 2-1/4\" (57mm) Speaker Type: Stereo, Built-In Speaker Type: Stereo, Built-In Dimensions (Approx.): 7-1/2\" x 3-2/3\" x 8-3/4\" (190 x 93 x 222mm) Dimensions (Approx.): 7-1/2\" x 3-2/3\" x 8-3/4\" (190 x 93 x 222mm) Weight (Approx.): 3 lbs 5 oz (1.5kg) Weight (Approx.): 3 lbs 5 oz (1.5kg)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31BJAFNlFmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sony","source_asin":"B004E2P8HA","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1175182","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004E2P8HA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B004E2P8HA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
