window.products.push({"id":1175430,"name":"CareUAll Laptop Bed Tray Desk, Portable Bed Tray Table, with T-Shaped Legs & Adjustable Height & Desktop, Foldable Lap Desk for Working Reading Writin","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TQDqJRqWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From an ergonomic view, it’s a bad idea to use a laptop while in bed, but the pleasure is irresistible. Fortunately, the tiltable laptop desk for bed is a great solution that prevents people from hunching over and damaging their neck and spine. Whether people are compelled to work from home while practicing social distancing or simply want a lapdesk for writing and routine tasks, this laptop desk is going to make their favorite place to get work done, eat or lounge. The tiltable desktop has four tilting angles (0°, 12°, 24° to 36°) to choose from. You can choose an angle that suits your best posture and provides a better viewing experience for reading a tablet or book. It's easy to change the desktop's tilting angle - just hold the two side lock buttons at the same time and you can adjust the slope. The height of the lap table is also adjustable from 9.65'' to 12.8'', allowing ample space for your legs while working from bed. Five different heights mean you can use it on top of any surface as a standing desk, or just kick back and relax horizontally with the portable bed desk. It's easy to adjust the height. To raise the height, simply pull the desk legs upward; To lower the desktop, press the lock button and press down the leg at the same time. This mini desk is really light-weight and practical. With the legs folded back, it can save a lot of space while not in use. The concise design graces your home office. This tray table satisfies people who like to work, study or read in bed and also pay attention to spine health. With ergonomics and spine health in mind, we provide this bed table to customers. It is certain to make a difference to your spine health.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TQDqJRqWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CareUAll","source_asin":"B08SWGPKDS","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1175430","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SWGPKDS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SWGPKDS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
