window.products.push({"id":1175466,"name":"Qty 2 Fitbit Charge HR Button Charging Clasp Replacement Plastic Band Clip","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41T1WWtDQ7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Note: This part is 3D printed and will not identically match the look/finish of your OEM piece. Printed in the USA! The design is 1 piece with an integrated button. That means this piece replaces the button, the band or cover the charger plugs into, and the spring plate in one piece. A major issue with the OEM design was due to small pieces that could easily be lost, that has been eliminated in this design. My piece is specifically made to replace a piece that was broken off (not a piece carefully removed to replace a broken wrist band, even though it would replace this too). You will not see 4 pins on the inside as this would complicate replacement because most break inside the fitbit when the piece breaks off. That means you only need to superglue it on and don't need to worry about carefully extracting the pins from your fitbit. Please validate your device is still functional before purchasing. You should be able to hold the charger on to check that the device will still charge and shows a charge screen. You can also gently press with a paperclip in the area where the button used to be to make sure the button electronics are still working properly. If either of these do not function properly this replacement will not fix your fitbit. Q&A Does it come with the wrist band? No, it is the piece that houses the button and where the charger plugs in. If I just lost my button and not the whole plastic piece can I use this as a fix? Yes, it will require you to remove the original plastic charging band and glue this in its place if yours is still there. Most people lose everything together so this is not normally the case though. Do I need to glue it? I highly recommend super gluing it on. It will hold in place by itself but the charger will want to pull it off when plugged in. Mine has not been glued since I test fit all the pieces, but you are more likely to have to come back to me to get another since it could fall off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41T1WWtDQ7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blanton","source_asin":"B075JGD3JT","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1175466","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075JGD3JT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B075JGD3JT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1175467,"name":"TNP Cat6 Ethernet Cable (Right Angle Up, 6 FT) RJ45 90 Degree Network Connector 500 MHz 10 Gigabit Gold Plated Patch Plug Wire LAN Cord for PS4 Fire-S","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SRU0FMNCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Future-Proof Speed - This cable provides exceptional transmission performance and low signal losses; Supports up to 500 MHz and is suitable for Fast Ethernet, Gigabit Ethernet, and 10-Gbps Ethernet; Downward compatible with preceding Ethernet standards such as Cat5 and Cat5e 90 Degree Right Angle Up - This straight to right angle network cable with upward modular connector offers a clutter-free solution when connecting network devices in compact and cramp spaces such as in the back of furniture or in a network closet; No more force-bending any straight patch cable which could lead to damaging the cable or affecting the data transmitting speed High-Performance Quality - Made out of 4 unshielded twisted pairs (UTP) of ultra-thick oxygen-free copper core, molded strain-relief boots, corrosion resistance, and gold-plated contacts provide better immunity from crosstalk, maximize conductivity and minimize noises and signal interferences that can degrade the signal quality; Ensure high signal quality over long-distance transmission High Bandwidth Applications - The bandwidth up to 500 MHz ensures secure high-speed data transfer for server applications, cloud computing, video surveillance, and online high definition Full HD 1080P 4K UHD Ultra HD video streaming, online gaming, etc Universal Compatibility - Cat6 8P8C modular 26AWG RJ45 connector cable provides universal connectivity for LAN network components such as PCs, computer servers, modems, printers, routers, switch boxes, TV boxes, network media players, NAS, VoIP phones, PoE devices, and more; Meets or exceeds Category 6 performance in compliance with the TIA/EIA 568-C.2 standard and UL 444 specifications","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SRU0FMNCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TNP Products","source_asin":"B077T6QKJR","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1175467","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077T6QKJR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B077T6QKJR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
