window.products.push({"id":1175821,"name":"CRRXIAN HDMI Wireless Display Dongle Adapter, 1080P WiFi Mobile Screen Mirroring Receiver for Phone/Tablet/iOS/Android/Windows/Mac OS to TV Projector ","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qCsHKoLmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Warm Tips: 1.Please confirm that your cell phone or tablet is compatible with WIFi CERTIFIED Miracast or Apple Airplay before purchasing. 2.Power adapter is 5V/1A at least so that ensures stable power supply. 3.Please read the user manual to hardware installation at first .Follow the instructions to complete setup. Wireless HDMI Display Dongle Adapter enable you to enjoy a HD big screen without carrying messy cords.1080P Definition Display：Wireless Display Dongle offers you the most clear and vivid images in a large screen.You can mirror the content (HD video/game/music/photo/file) in your smartphone/tablet/PC/Mac directly to HDMI devices such as TV and projector.Pocket Size:Wireless display dongle can realize important business meetings, office routine meetings, school multimedia campus education, home theater entertainment, and output from smart phones, tablets or Macbooks anytime, anywhere information. It is undoubtedly a money-saving, simple and convenient choice.Good for your eyes: Staring at a small screen for a long time will cause discomfort in the eyes, so it is easy to cause myopia. But project to the big screen, away from the small screen.HOW TO USBSet up Android(Miracast)1.Wait for MiraScreen main screen after power on.2.Turn on your Android menu and open Miracast.3.Select MiraScreen as target and wait for connection.4.Your Android screen will be shown on your TV,reconnect if necessary.Set up ios(iPhone/iPad):1.Wait for MiraScreen main screen after power on.2.Connect your iPhone with MiraScreen via WI-FI,start browser on your iPhone to set up Internet for MiraScreen(connect MiraScreen to your home WI-FI router)3.Connect your iPhone to home WI-FI router.Swipe up on your iPhone and tap on AirPlay mirroring,then select MiraScreen as target.4.Your iPhone/iPad screen will be shown on your TV through MiraScreen.Package:1x HDMI Wireless Display Dongle,1x Instruction,1x USB Cable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qCsHKoLmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CERRXIAN","source_asin":"B08JGL7ZRB","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1175821","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JGL7ZRB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JGL7ZRB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
